# 📌 Project Overview

The GraphOne AI Intelligence Pipeline automatically gathers fresh AI ecosystem data including:

* AI Startups
* AI Products
* AI Research Papers
* AI Jobs
* AI News

The pipeline performs asynchronous scraping, retry handling, payload chunking, LLM fallback orchestration, entity deduplication, and exports clean CSV datasets.

---

# ✨ Features

* ✅ Async scraping using `asyncio` and `aiohttp`
* ✅ Retry logic with exponential backoff for API rate limits
* ✅ Payload chunking to prevent HTTP 413 errors
* ✅ Multi-tier LLM fallback (Gemini → Groq → DeepSeek)
* ✅ Freshness filtering for Jobs & News (last 24 hours)
* ✅ Entity deduplication and canonical mapping
* ✅ CSV export ready for PostgreSQL / Neo4j ingestion
* ✅ Google Sheets export for review

