python src/jobs_scraper.py
python src/news_scraper.py
python src/github_startup_scraper.py
python src/product_scraper.py
```

Run merge pipeline

```bash
python src/merge_startups.py
```

Run retry test

```bash
python src/test_retry.py
```

Run LLM orchestrator

```bash
python src/llm_orchestrator.py
```

